@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam ParticipantPadding 5
hide footbox
title Confirm (2) — commit kho và hoàn tất
participant CheckoutOrchestrator as O
participant "Inventory API / Repo" as I
database inventory_db as IDB
participant PrismaInvoiceRepository as R
database sales_db as SDB
O -> I : lookup(invoiceId,cid)
opt RESERVED
 O -> I : commit(reservationId,cid,cashierId)
 group local inventoryWrite TX
  I -> IDB : onHand-=q; reserved-=q; version++
  I -> IDB : SALE(actor=cashierId); COMMITTED
 end
end
I --> O : COMMITTED (kể cả retry)
O -> R : complete(id)
group local salesWrite TX
 R -> SDB : outbox PENDING + COMPLETED/NONE
end
note over O,SDB
Remote timeout hoặc local completion lỗi:
RECOVERY/COMMIT; giữ payment, lookup trước retry.
Không rollback tiền; checkout không chờ RabbitMQ.
end note
@enduml
